<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/1.0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/1.0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Min> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/1.0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sample> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/1.0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/1.0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/1.0> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> .
