_:genid10 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/hasAggregationOperator> .
_:genid10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/KeyPerformanceIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid11 .
_:genid11 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onDataRange> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
