# https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorShape
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
