<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperator> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Median"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Median"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Determines the middle value of the sorted aggregated set, separating the upper half from the lower half. Not available as a native SPARQL function but can be computed through subqueries."@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ermittelt den Zentralwert der sortierten aggregierten Menge, der die obere von der unteren Hälfte trennt. Nicht als native SPARQL-Funktion verfügbar, kann aber durch Unterabfragen berechnet werden."@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "MEDIAN" .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Median"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Median"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Median> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
