<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Min> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Determines the smallest value in the aggregated set. Corresponds to the SPARQL function MIN()."@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Min> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ermittelt den kleinsten Wert in der aggregierten Menge. Entspricht der SPARQL-Funktion MIN()."@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Min> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
