<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sample> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sample> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperator> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sample> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
