<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sample"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sample> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Stichprobe"@de .
