# https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperator> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Standard Deviation"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Standardabweichung"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Berechnet die Standardabweichung der Werte in der aggregierten Menge als Maß für die Streuung um den Mittelwert. Nicht als native SPARQL-Funktion verfügbar, aber in einigen Triplestore-Erweiterungen unterstützt."@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Computes the standard deviation of values in the aggregated set as a measure of dispersion around the mean. Not available as a native SPARQL function but supported in some triplestore extensions."@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "STDEV" .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Standard Deviation"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Standardabweichung"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/StandardDeviation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
# 
# https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperator> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sum"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Summe"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Berechnet die Gesamtsumme aller Werte in der aggregierten Menge. Entspricht der SPARQL-Funktion SUM()."@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Computes the total sum of all values in the aggregated set. Corresponds to the SPARQL function SUM()."@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "SUM" .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sum"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Summe"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Sum> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
# 
# https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperator> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Variance"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Varianz"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Berechnet die Varianz der Werte in der aggregierten Menge als Quadrat der Standardabweichung. Nicht als native SPARQL-Funktion verfügbar, aber in einigen Triplestore-Erweiterungen unterstützt."@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Computes the variance of values in the aggregated set as the square of the standard deviation. Not available as a native SPARQL function but supported in some triplestore extensions."@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "VAR" .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Variance"@en .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Varianz"@de .
<https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/Variance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://semantic.adorsys.com/meta/kpi/AggregationOperatorScheme/1.0> .
